<title>UK: BOE invites fixed rate ops, shortage 1.1 bln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE invites fixed rate ops, shortage 1.1 bln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited UK money market operators to offer repos to March 26 &amp; April 1 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before April 1.</p>
<p>The Bank's repo rate is unchanged at 6.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
